00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:58,500
The search for our beginning could lead to our end.

2
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:51,000
Prometheus is a science fiction, adventure,
mystery film directed by Ridley Scott.

3
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:43,500
A team of explorers discover a clue to the origins of mankind on Earth,
leading them on a journey to the darkest corners of the universe.

4
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
There, they must fight a terrifying battle to save the future of the human race.

5
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:28,500
Elizabeth Shaw, played by Noomi Rapace.

6
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:21,000
David, played by Michael Fassbender.

7
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:13,500
Meredith Vickers, played by Charlize Theron.

8
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:06,000
Janek, played by Idris Elba.

9
00:34:52,500 --> 00:34:58,500
Peter Weyland, played by Guy Pearce.

10
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:51,000
Charlie Holloway, played by Logan Marshall-Green.

11
00:42:37,500 --> 00:42:43,500
Prometheus is a 2012 science fiction horror film directed by Ridley
Scott and written by Jon Spaihts and Damon Lindelof.

12
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
It is the fifth installment of the Alien film series and features an ensemble cast including Noomi
Rapace, Michael Fassbender, Guy Pearce, Idris Elba, Logan Marshall-Green, and Charlize Theron.

13
00:50:22,500 --> 00:50:28,500
Set in the late 21st century, the film centers on the crew of the spaceship Prometheus as it
follows a star map discovered among the artifacts of several ancient Earth cultures.

14
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:21,000
Seeking the origins of humanity, the crew arrives on a distant world and
discovers a threat that could cause human extinction.

15
00:58:07,500 --> 00:58:13,500
Scott and director James Cameron developed ideas for a film that would serve as
a prequel to Scott's science-fiction horror film Alien (1979).

16
01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
In 2002, the development of Alien vs.

17
01:05:52,500 --> 01:05:58,500
Predator (2004) took precedence, and the project remained
dormant until 2009 when Scott again showed interest.

18
01:09:45,000 --> 01:09:51,000
Spaihts wrote a script for a prequel to the events of the Alien films, but Scott opted
for a different direction to avoid repeating cues from those films.

19
01:13:37,500 --> 01:13:43,500
In late 2010, Lindelof joined the project to rewrite Spaihts' script, and he and Scott developed a story
that precedes the story of Alien but is not directly connected to the original series.

20
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:36,000
According to Scott, although the film shares "strands of Alien's DNA," and takes place
in the same universe, Prometheus explores its own mythology and ideas.

21
01:21:22,500 --> 01:21:28,500
Prometheus entered production in April 2010, with extensive design phases during which
the technology and creatures that the film required were developed.

22
01:25:15,000 --> 01:25:21,000
Principal photography began in March 2011, with an
estimated $120–130 million budget.

23
01:29:07,500 --> 01:29:13,500
The film was shot using 3D cameras throughout, almost entirely on practical sets,
and on location in England, Iceland, Scotland, Jordan, and Spain.

24
01:33:00,000 --> 01:33:06,000
It was promoted with a marketing campaign that
included viral activities on the web.

25
01:36:52,500 --> 01:36:58,500
Three videos featuring the film's leading actors in character, which expanded on elements of the
fictional universe, were released and met with a generally positive reception and awards.

26
01:40:45,000 --> 01:40:51,000
Prometheus was released on June 1, 2012, in the United
Kingdom and on June 8, 2012, in North America.

27
01:44:37,500 --> 01:44:43,500
The film earned generally positive reviews, receiving praise for the
designs, production values, and cast performances.

28
01:48:30,000 --> 01:48:36,000
The film grossed over $403 million worldwide.

29
01:52:22,500 --> 01:52:28,500
A sequel, Alien: Covenant, was released in May 2017.

30
01:56:15,000 --> 01:56:21,000
The film explores themes of android, alien, space, creature, spin off.

31
02:00:07,500 --> 02:00:13,500
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and mind_bending.
